tau0 SCALE: SPECTRAL NORM (V3) vs SPECTRAL RANGE (V5)
====================================================================================================
  H_sense is traceless, so range/2 <= ||H0||_2 <= range and V5's tau0 is
  always 1x-2x smaller. Cost of the smaller tau0 is readout resolution.

       problem    ||H0||     range   ratio   lam_min   lam_max    bin V3    bin V5
